<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE MATCH SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE MATCH SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sunday's English premier league match:</p>
<p>Tottenham 1 (Wilson penalty 64th minute) Leicester 2 (Claridge 22nd, Marshall 86th). Halftime 0-1. Attendance: 24,159.</p>
